,iv_none_body:"Intervention memory measures what past jobs actually changed, so it needs a recorded job history. Public volumetric data does not publish one. Switch to the synthetic demo to see the full capability, or import an operator job history.",iv_recorded:"Recorded historical intervention",iv_model:"AI / model recommendation",dm_label:"Data mode",dm_synthetic:"Synthetic",dm_real:"Real data",dm_syn_line:"Synthetic Demo • Simulated SCADA",dm_real_needs:"No real public data set is imported yet.",dm_switching:"Switching data mode…",dm_reporting:"Reporting period",dm_scada_sim:"Simulated live telemetry (demo)",dm_scada_off:"Live SCADA not connected",p_kind:"Type of number",p_source:"Source",p_formula:"Formula",p_unit:"Unit",p_window:"Period",p_limits:"Limitations",p_k_reported:"Reported — declared to a regulator or by an operator",p_k_derived:"Derived — arithmetic on reported values",p_k_model_estimate:"Model estimate — carries uncertainty, not a measurement",p_k_illustrative_assumption:"Illustrative assumption — editable in Settings",p_k_synthetic:"Synthetic — generated to validate the method",p_k_not_available:"Not available — no source publishes this",p_src_assumption:"CORE economic assumptions (Settings)",p_src_model:"CORE model output",p_src_none:"No source — not published anywhere",p_w_latest:"Latest reported period in the active data set",p_l_monthly:"Monthly reported volumes, not live telemetry",p_l_ruleset:"Depends on the threshold rules in Settings",p_l_counterfactual:"Compared against an estimated no-intervention baseline, not an observed one",p_l_range:"Point value; see the stated range",p_l_costs:"Prices and costs are illustrative until operator data is connected",p_l_capacity:"Facility capacity is operator data and is assumed here",p_l_undefined:"Undefined, not zero, when no liquid was reported",p_l_interventions:"Public data contains no intervention history",p_l_naive:"Before/after only — does not separate the job from field-wide change",p_l_synthetic_only:"Measured against planted truth; only meaningful on the synthetic validation set",p_l_derived_status:"Derived from the AER well category string by a documented rule",p_l_unique_join:"Only legal locations holding exactly one AER record and one reporting well are linked",p_l_no_scada:"SCADA is not connected; no public source publishes sensor readings",g_title:"How to use CORE",g_badge:"Start here",g_open_map:"Open the Alberta map",g_open_overview:"Open the overview",g_sub:"CORE turns official, public oil-and-gas records into decisions an engineer can defend. Every number on every screen names its source.",g_kpi_wells:"Real Alberta wells",g_kpi_prod:"Reported production rows",g_kpi_linked:"Wells linked to production",g_kpi_linked_sub:"unique legal-location match",g_kpi_scada:"Live SCADA telemetry",g_kpi_scada_sub:"no public source exists",g_not_connected:"NOT CONNECTED",g_how_title:"How a number reaches your screen",g_how_sub:"The same four stages apply to every value CORE shows.",g_flow_source:"1 · Official source",g_flow_source_d:"AER and Petrinex public records are downloaded and kept as files, with the date they were retrieved.",g_flow_validate:"2 · Validate",g_flow_validate_d:"Columns, identifiers and coordinates are checked. A failed or empty import is rejected and the previous data is kept.",g_flow_calc:"3 · Calculate",g_flow_calc_d:"Rates, water cut, decline and economics are computed from the imported rows with fixed, written-down formulas.",g_flow_explain:"4 · Explain",g_flow_explain_d:"Each result carries its source, formula and limitations, shown by the information icon next to it.",g_start_title:"Four things to try first",g_start_sub:"In order — each takes under a minute.",g_s1:"Look at the field",g_s1_d:"Open the map. Zoom into a cluster until individual wells appear, then click one to see its real identifier, coordinates and reported production.",g_s2:"Check where the data came from",g_s2_d:"The Data hub lists every source, how many rows it holds and when it was last imported. View schema shows the columns actually imported, not a description.",g_s3:"See the opportunity",g_s3_d:"The overview ranks wells by estimated recoverable opportunity, and separates what is measured from what is estimated.",g_s4:"Question any number",g_s4_d:"Hover the information icon beside a value to see its formula, inputs, period and limitations. If a number cannot be explained, it should not be trusted.",g_trust_title:"How to read the labels",g_trust_sub:"Every value is tagged so you always know what kind of number you are looking at.",g_k_reported:"Declared to a regulator or by an operator. Taken as given.",g_k_derived:"Arithmetic on reported values, using a formula you can inspect and reproduce.",g_k_model:"A model output with an uncertainty range, not a measurement.",g_k_assumption:"A price, cost or capacity CORE assumes because no operator data is connected. Editable in Settings.",g_k_synthetic:"Generated data, used only to prove the method works. Never mixed with real data.",g_k_missing:"No source publishes this. It is left empty rather than invented.",g_i_hint:"Where do I find the explanation of a number?",g_i_explain:"Look for the small round information icon next to a value. Hover it to read the formula and source; click it to keep the card open while you compare.",g_not_title:"What CORE does not have",g_not_sub:"Stated plainly, so nothing is implied that is not true.",g_not_scada:"Live sensor readings — pressure, temperature, vibration, pump and choke. No public source publishes them.",g_not_interventions:"Intervention and workover history for Alberta. Public volumetric data does not contain it.",g_not_costs:"Real operator costs and facility capacities. Prices and costs shown are illustrative assumptions.",g_not_operator:"Any SOCAR or operator data. None is bundled, connected or fabricated.",g_ctx_title:"Two separate data planes",g_ctx_sub:"CORE keeps them apart on purpose, and never presents one as the other.",g_ctx_anal